BUT classroom access for the NEXT phase must ALWAYS require:
MANUAL ADMIN APPROVAL.

This is the same philosophy as the old booking system.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
CORE BUSINESS RULE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

COMPLETING A PHASE
DOES NOT AUTOMATICALLY UNLOCK THE NEXT CLASSROOM.

Instead:

100% Completion
→ Eligible to request next phase
→ Submit booking request
→ Admin review
→ Approval
→ Add phaseId into unlockedPhases
→ Classroom becomes accessible

